Hims & Hers (
HIMS
)
-29.9% Last 3m
Hims & Hers, launched in 2017, is a telehealth platform that connects patient=
s and healthcare providers to offer treatment options for specialties like er=
ectile dysfunction, hair loss, skin care, mental health, and weight loss. Its=
 offerings include generic, branded, and compounded prescription drugs as wel=
l as over-the-counter medicines, cosmetics, and supplements. The platform, wh=
ich has more than 2 million subscribers, is available in all 50 states and ce=
rtain European markets like the UK. It includes provider networks, electronic=
 medical records, cloud pharmacy fulfillment, and personalization capabilitie=
s. Hims does not take insurance and only accepts payments directly from custo=
mers.
