Surgery Partners announced a definitive agreement to sell its interests in th=
e Idaho Falls market, including Mountain View Hospital and Idaho Falls Commun=
ity Hospital, to Intermountain Health. This transaction represents the vast m=
ajority of planned portfolio optimization to sharpen focus on core short-stay=
 surgical facilities and strengthen the balance sheet.
At a Glance
